WEBVTT

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.370
Ichigo!

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.310
Ichigo...

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.650
It’s cold!

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.490
That’s because the water is from the melting snow.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.040
The air feels really nice.

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:58.950
Really.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.090
Ichigo, look at this.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.410
Go!

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:08.050
Amazing!

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:11.100
Bu-Ling can at least do that.

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.970
No way!

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:19.680
Everyone, the barbeque is ready.

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:23.640
Itadakimasu!

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.310
Delicious!

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.650
Barbeque tastes great.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:39.240
Having a meal under the blue sky feels really good.

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:43.670
Recently, it’s been a very hard time for everyone.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:46.960
I was thinking that it’s good to have fun sometimes.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:51.510
There are still many things you will have to do.

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:55.600
The fighting will be over soon.

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:57.970
<i>Ichigo-san...?</i>

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.260
<i>Isn’t that still rare?</i>

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:06.920
Minto-oneechan is also wild today.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:11.190
There’s no choice. There aren’t any knives or forks.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:14.440
If you act like a snob in this place,
it won’t taste good.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.910
No matter what you do, you’re
amazing, Zakuro-oneesama.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.080
Aoyama-kun, try some too.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.300
Thank you.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.170
You had sauce on you.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.980
I’m so embarrassed.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:51.610
Somehow, I’m extremely
happy right now.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:58.200
Everyone from the café is here, and being
together with Aoyama-kun as well now...

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.280
It seems a little like a dream.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.110
Dream?

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.970
What’s wrong, Aoyama-kun?

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.380
It’s nothing.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:19.850
I also couldn’t imagine being together with
everyone from the café just before this.

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:24.480
I wish we could spend time like this forever...

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:27.660
I wish that someday our duties as Mew Mew would end,

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.850
and I could return to being an ordinary girl...

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.490
And then...

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.440
It will be okay. For sure!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:40.030
Soon, everyone will return to their normal lives.

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:44.910
At that time, our true time will begin for sure.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.450
Our... time...?

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:51.120
Ichigo’s and my true time.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:52.970
Aoyama-kun.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:59.140
Hey, everyone, gather up.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.180
There was a reason for inviting you all here today.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:07.560
The truth is there was a response
from Mew Aqua close by.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.770
That means...

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.220
The final Mew Aqua?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.900
It was from a few days ago.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:18.120
A very faint reaction from Mew
Aqua appeared around here.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.900
I’d like everyone to start searching for the Mew Aqua.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:26.990
It wasn’t an ordinary barbecue party?!

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.870
Around here you said.
Where do you mean?

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:32.700
It is... over there.

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:40.250
That’s the mountain I had a bad feeling about earlier.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:45.720
We can’t allow the aliens to take it
before us. Everyone, fight hard.

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:50.680
If there was such an important thing, say it sooner.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.230
I’m completely in vacation mode.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:56.560
Just think of it as hiking while on vacation then.

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:00.440
It will be fine, Ichigo.
I’ll be there to help you out.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.530
Aoyama-kun...

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:09.830
Everyone, my apologies, but please do your best.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.500
Alright.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.170
Aoyama.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.430
Why do you believe
the fight will end soon?

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.340
Who are you really?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:28.900
What do you mean by that?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.980
Who am I?

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.860
Ichigo...

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:49.660
It’s okay. Ichigo... Protect the other Mew Mew’s for me.

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.170
Shirogane-san.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:01.710
It finally came to this.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.260
Ichigo-san, no whining, no whining.

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.050
Bu-Ling is having a bit of fun.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.270
Let’s quickly find it and get back, Oneesama.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:19.490
You have kindly taken my invitation, Aoyama.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.490
This place is a little scary.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:33.540
Mew Aqua is in a place like this?

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:36.120
Amazing hills.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.290
Erosion from the rain and wind.

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:42.330
Nature creates this scenery over
tens of thousands of years.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.300
Rabbit-san!

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.760
Over here is Crab-san.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.510
This is fun!

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:50.260
Hey!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.730
Bu-Ling...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:01.240
This seems just like a maze.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.070
It seems like we can’t return.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:08.740
Ah. I wonder if it’s going to rain?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.660
A mountain’s weather can change really easy.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.330
Everyone, be careful
not to stray too far.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.500
Ichigo! Alien! Alien!

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:21.590
Surely they’re looking
for the Mew Aqua.

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:25.380
E-Earthquake?!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.420
S-S-Scary!

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.970
Look! The sky!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.270
Th-That’s...

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.400
Ichigo, if this continues, it can be dangerous.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:45.310
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:57.880
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.720
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:14.230
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:19.820
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:34.570
The number of members increased, and
our courage increased a hundred times!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.130
We’ll be of service a hundred times harder nyan~!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.290
Everyone, gather together
into one group.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:46.960
Aoyama-kun!

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:52.880
Oneesama!

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:56.190
Ichigo!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.640
Aoyama-kun!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.460
This is?

00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:28.800
It’s been a while.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.260
You’re an alien!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:43.350
You don’t remember me, do you?
You took everything from me!

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:53.030
Let’s end this right here. If I win,
let me do with Ichigo as I please.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.490
Blue Knight.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.590
What’s going on, Keiichirou?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:18.590
It’s bad. I can’t reach Ichigo
and the others.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:23.430
The whole mountain seems to have been surrounded by an alternate dimension field.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:32.310
Oneesama? Anyone? This stone wall!

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.660
Bu-Ling-san, are you alright?

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.250
My usual power won’t come out.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:47.050
So this means... we can’t get out of here?

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:57.170
Somehow, it seems that we’ve fallen into a trap.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:02.060
Anyone? Where did you go?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.690
Aoyama-kun! Aoyama-kun!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.230
This is the labyrinth of the alternate dimension.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.990
That Mew Aqua response was a fake.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.700
I didn’t really think you’d fall into the trap this nicely.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.200
What did you say?

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.160
No one can escape from the labyrinth.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:28.160
Just so you and I can have this one-on-one fight.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.800
Let’s have a serious man-to-man fight, okay?

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.640
You have a serious debt to fulfill.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:43.180
First, you interfered with the Earth
recovery plan. My gratitude.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:50.520
Next, for having Deep Blue abandon me.

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:58.720
But you know what?

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:04.070
I really don’t care about the Earth
recovery plan or Deep Blue anymore.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:09.290
What hurt the most was Ichigo.
You took my important toy away.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:17.420
That’s right. Only Ichigo is like a piercing thorn to me.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.390
A continuing pain in my chest that will never end...

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.070
I will return this pain right back at you!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.120
It serves you right.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:40.570
By the way, why aren’t you becoming the Blue Knight?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:47.030
Or could it possibly be that you
can’t become the Blue Knight?

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.580
That’s it! You can’t become the Blue Knight!

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:57.550
If Ichigo isn’t around, you can’t become the Blue Knight!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:10.610
What is this?

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.400
What? What is going on?

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:24.400
Anyone? Aoyama-kun?
If you can hear me, answer!

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:29.740
Aoyama-kun.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:34.830
<i>Aoyama-kun!</i>

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.250
Ichigo!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:41.720
What’s wrong? Try it.
Become the Blue Knight.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:53.610
That’s what it was. I remember.
I heard it. Always...

00:13:54.600 --> 00:14:03.990
Ichigo’s voice... sad... happy...
angry... laughing...

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.830
...and the voice she called out with.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:14.590
That’s it. The voice she called out to me with.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:17.970
When Ichigo called me...

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.880
...I gained unbelievable power.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:27.840
I can become the Blue Knight
whenever Ichigo wishes for it.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.680
Such a thing won’t happen again.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:35.400
Because I will break you right here.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.310
Ichigo..

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:42.270
<i>Ichigo!</i>

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.150
Aoyama-kun!

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.150
Break! Blue Knight!

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:57.670
Aoyama-kun! Hang in there!
Aoyama-kun!

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.540
What a cruel thing...

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:03.010
It’s not like I meant to hurt him.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:07.710
I just wanted a one-on-one battle with the Blue Knight.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:12.640
But for him, he couldn’t do it without Ichigo.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:17.520
Because, if he’s not protecting Ichigo,
he can’t become the Blue Knight.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.150
What did you say?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:23.530
Relax. He’s not broken yet.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:25.690
Quiche!

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:29.950
I still have to make him suffer more.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.410
Aoyama-kun!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.790
It’s certain death.

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:45.710
There won’t be anyone else
to come save you.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:48.590
Ichigo. That appearance.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:53.380
That’s certainly the most painful thing for him.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:58.810
Strange, isn’t it?
He’s certainly broken now.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:04.810
But from now on, you will become my toy
without hesitation. Right, Ichigo?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.820
Even if Aoyama-kun were to die...

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:11.490
...even if Aoyama-kun began to dislike me...

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:15.240
...I will never go with you!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.580
The one I like is Aoyama-kun!

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.290
If Aoyama-kun were to die, I would...

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:25.510
In that case, I will do as you desire.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.890
Get away from Ichigo!

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:36.090
Aoyama-kun!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.610
Don’t touch Ichigo!

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:54.320
Finally you’ve become the Blue Knight.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:59.120
I’m going to make Ichigo suffer...
Right in front of your eyes!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:07.460
That’s right! That’s right!

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:11.260
I’ll break her! I’ll break Ichigo!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:17.680
Aoyama-kun!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:36.910
Ichigo.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:38.370
Ichigo-san.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.540
All of you.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:50.420
That’s right! This moment!
This is what I’ve been waiting for!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.880
W-What’s this?

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:53.970
Aoyama-kun!

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:55.800
Wait! It’s dangerous.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.550
B-But...

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.810
Everyone, put up a shield.

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:15.330
This is it! This power!

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:25.200
W-What is this? This energy?

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.670
Ryou, this is dangerous. Let’s run.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.350
That was incredible.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.230
What on earth just happened?

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:55.160
The stone wall disappeared, and
I thought I could meet you all.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:57.250
Ichigo?

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:02.660
Aoyama-kun! Aoyama-kun!
Hang in there!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.630
Aoyama-kun!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:11.080
Aoyama-kun... I-I’m so relieved.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:15.050
Ichigo, what happened to me?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:18.350
It’s alright now. Can you stand?

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:21.180
Ichigo-oneechan.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.930
Everyone, thank you.

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.640
I’m relieved. Everyone is safe.

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:38.990
Amazing hole!

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.280
I-I can’t believe we lived through this..

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:43.830
Frightening!

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:50.170
Aoyama-kun...?

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.250
Hey, are you okay?

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:00.170
Somehow.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:03.140
What on earth did you do?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.860
There was a tremendous energy response.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:11.680
I staked my life on it, but I verified it with my own eyes.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:17.660
The Blue Knight...
For sure, <i>he</i> is our savior.

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:25.800
The final battle is close.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.130
Then, we have to be more
and more careful.

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.120
Right, Aoyama-kun?

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.340
What’s this? Aoyama-kun?

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:35.010
In the whole area of Tokyo, the Chimera Animas have appeared in great numbers!

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:36.760
Tokyo Mew Mew, GO!!

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:39.640
But Shirogane, Aoyama-kun disappeared.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:40.310
What did you say?

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:41.920
Where did he go?

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:43.160
Aoyama-kun?

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:45.250
Aoyama-kun!

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:50.150
Next: “The Awakening of Blue:
Another Appearance”

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:53.200
What is this uneasiness?
